OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: Saved cameras connect over your Wi-Fi or hotspot. Long-press the picture for AE lock; AWB lock is in WB. Redesigned Multiview and Wi-Fi setup. Double-tap to track, joystick sizes, glass pills. Shutter angle holds when FPS changes. Adds LEVEL, experimental Action 6, less CPU. Fixes discovery permissions, Media libraries, Live View crashes, video freezes, Nano zoom, clip deletion, portrait Recenter and gimbal panel. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
